    `help_text` = 'Search active locations by campus, library, location name, or location code; select up to 100 locations and choose Effective item or Permanent item as the location basis. Add one to five contiguous MARC conditions and combine them as all conditions (AND) or any condition (OR). A condition can find a matching field occurrence or an instance missing one. Results contain one row per instance and report the conditions evaluated for each row. These findings are facts, not cataloging judgments; review them in the context of record type, cataloging rules, legacy practice, and local policy. Holdings with no items (Smith) searches Smith-owned MARC instances with holdings and no items; suppressed records are included and marked-for-deletion records are excluded. Instances with no holdings (Smith) searches Smith-owned MARC instances without holdings; suppressed records are included and marked-for-deletion records are excluded.'
WHERE `slug` = 'marc-field-combination-finder'
  AND SHA2(`sql_template`, 256) = 'e25101e5af5365f4c64d09486145afaaf9e150c101ee8c52d195c1900cf71122';

COMMIT;
